 "description": "At TheFamily, we believe that anyone can become a great entrepreneur. Find more info here: http://www.thefamily.co/\nBy Taavet Hinrikus, CEO at TransferWise - @taavet\n\nTransferWise is ripping through its industry, changing money transfer from a slow, expensive chore into an impossibly cheap, easy and fast process.  \nTo date, TransferWise has processed over $3bn in transactions, saving their customers $150m in bank fees!  \n\nPrior to starting TransferWise, Taavet was Skype’s director of strategy until 2008, starting as its first-ever employee. He’s also a mentor and angel investor. His investments include Tweetdeck, Mendeley, OMGPOP, Betaworks, Sunrise, Improbable and Mapillary among others. Taavet is an adviser to Prime Minister of Estonia on the digital agenda.",
